[{"title":"枫桥湾酒家有枫桥千古压波光之句用韵以纪所见","author":"朱南杰","text":"枫桥酒味胜官坊，随分红裙取次妆。\n月照乍圆新气象，僧闲不减旧风光。\n一桥地势横分水，两岸人家竞采桑。\n惟有塔铃太多管，笑人来往自玎珰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38535,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊崇德","author":"朱南杰","text":"堰未抵长河，先从古县过。\n诗舟寻旧岸，酒市鬻新歌。\n傍水人家密，依山僧寺多。\n夷犹观未足，无柰月明何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38536,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饯徐衍道知县","author":"朱南杰","text":"事业文章属当家，刃游馀地宰金沙。\n挽回凶岁作丰稔，安集流民绝叹嗟。\n两载秋霜威盗贼，一犁春雨沃桑麻。\n宽民实意言难尽，胜种河阳满县花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38537,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饯海盐史后乐","author":"朱南杰","text":"秦溪邑大号难治，后乐三年以德为。\n海阔有楼还旧观，堂深无日不新诗。\n虚舟祇载来时物，实惠常教去后思。\n相业真传公不忝，苍生况是望霖时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38538,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日呈?岩","author":"朱南杰","text":"朝来惭愧又逢春，总把官身换客身。\n堤柳未归新气象，窗梅犹带旧精神。\n村居牢落谁沽我，吏醉清闲却笑人。\n打叠故书排日去，一樽随意踏芳尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38539,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"除夜怀刘朋山为坑司干官","author":"朱南杰","text":"失脚糟丘又一春，岁除牢落颇关情。\n谁家不换桃符句，比屋相闻竹爆声。\n旧友未知能铸冶，新年宜入孰陶成。\n来朝无甚人交往，乐得齁齁睡到明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38540,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晓发嘉兴府","author":"朱南杰","text":"晓发嘉兴府，人家门未开。\n闸关船侧过，水涨堰平推。\n浓绿暗官柳，肥红绽野梅。\n城中箫鼓发，知是使君回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38541,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"烟雨楼","author":"朱南杰","text":"锦绣囊开城角东，规模绵亘境相通。\n一亭旧占梅边月，两径新添竹外风。\n山色有无烟变态，湖光浓淡雨收功。\n凭栏正好催归去，横笛数声芦苇中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38542,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"富民犯米四十字以喻之","author":"朱南杰","text":"彼此有人心，人心即讼庭。\n初无深利害，倒自费调亭。\n私意生荆棘，公家有典刑。\n落便宜是益，座右可刊铭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38543,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"延陵道中即事三绝 其二","author":"朱南杰","text":"人家密簇近溪旁，旧袂青裙竞采桑。\n相唤相呼相叹息，茧丝岁岁为官忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38544,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐书怀","author":"朱南杰","text":"挑灯看彻后村诗，忽尔憧憧百所思。\n不待人言已知错，要知分定盍如斯。\n但求甘旨安无事，浪说荣华自有时。\n倒指新篘当已熟，且煨闽芋一中之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38545,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石楼","author":"朱南金","text":"蒙茸披尽自成蹊，两扇岩扉向日齐。\n说与白云休锁钥，留将千古指人迷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38546,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古隍行","author":"朱南强","text":"茂林修竹恒苍苍，畦兰畹芷腾幽芳。\n郁葱佳气蔼祯祥，小小一村名古隍。\n屋西有山名虎耳，东流挹抱长溪水。\n三峰笔架卓面前，背后驹骊翠屏倚。\n绕檐数顷祖遗田，尽可容侬耕晓烟。\n摘山钓水美且鲜，南窗笑傲北窗眠。\n三馀祇把子孙教，不俾趁炎竞浮躁。\n先于道谊后文章，事长谦恭事亲孝。\n桑麻芋栗小园收，社酝茅柴逐旋篘。\n但得官清徭役省，此生温饱复何求。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38547,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过苏养直旧居","author":"朱复之","text":"诗人已化罗浮鹤，想未千年未一归。\n属玉不知人世换，双双长占后湖飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38548,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罗怀叟思归一诗留之","author":"朱复之","text":"客子归期莫有期，地炉松火独吟时。\n西山暮雨吹成雪，错拟杨花理钓丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38549,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"葛仙井","author":"朱复之","text":"葛翁凿井冽寒泉，浸熟丹砂去作仙。\n底事并烦仙子按，却随海水变桑田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38550,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢张生见湛卢歌","author":"朱复之","text":"剑术空疏今罢休，家山何处越中瓯。\n欲谈往事浑亡是，喜得新诗替莫愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38551,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋太湖石","author":"朱复之","text":"寂寂云根锁昼扉，绿痕春暖上苔衣。\n飞来黄鸟忽相问，看了几年花片飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38552,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠胡易鉴","author":"朱复之","text":"可怜扰扰鉴中人，五十枯蓍了此身。\n若欲致身须数外，何时日月得停轮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38553,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠黄五星","author":"朱复之","text":"寒灰枯木此心形，箕斗今须落姓名。\n却爱酒星凭一算，曲生何日放流行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38554,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日偕翁与可江正甫郑景云游凤山","author":"朱复之","text":"裹将破帽凤山游，凤去台空馀古丘。\n白发尚能今日客，黄花祇作故园秋。\n天浮渭北荒荒杳，江入旴南隐隐流。\n我始欲愁君且莫，人生何处是吾州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38555,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太平寺尘外闲题","author":"朱复之","text":"高树青圆不见天，小风微动竹梢偏。\n衣涵空翠元无雨，庭閟馀声独有蝉。\n老去此心无所住，向来我见不须先。\n狂吟但过寒山子，荐得腾腾一味禅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38556,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王补之梅竹","author":"朱复之","text":"淡抹斜斜三两枝，色香相亚恰相知。\n沙寒水浅魂初醒，月落窗空影半攲。\n岂是物华甘寂寞，且须岁晚共扶持。\n向来淮浦潇湘岸，绝爱萧萧雪打时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38557,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别李商卿","author":"朱复之","text":"羁思孤耽僻，蛩音偶出虚。\n绿阴分坐久，清话见情初。\n春过诗魂怯，年销剑术疏。\n相看渐成故，临别欲何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38558,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"滕王阁","author":"朱复之","text":"杰甚滕王阁，登临思渺然。\n宿云开北牖，秋水尽南天。\n帝子今何处，王童记独传。\n客怀无住著，浩荡白鸥前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38559,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与静使君约游姑山记事古风二十韵","author":"朱复之","text":"苦热日已远，杪秋遂凄凉。\n邦侯及清暇，小队豫郊岗。\n一麾先崭岩，半刺骖翱翔。\n卿月动左辖，客星移奉常。\n谁欤南冠者，共挹北斗浆。\n翠幄穿晨曦，锁金步流光。\n穷惚某氏建，架构溯斯堂。\n闽红倾泛盎，楚绿饾圆方。\n平原磊落人，仙碑勒荒唐。\n方平叱石起，来问东海桑。\n蔡子狗窦过，蛇蝉蜕冥茫。\n麻姑十八九，两髻已成霜。\n惟馀老杉星，省识邓紫阳。\n往事莽如迹，且醉糟书房。\n翼亭跻齐云，游目望八荒。\n挽河落飞瀑，洒雪芙蓉裳。\n夕矣憺将归，一一玉帝旁。\n蹇余雅幽寻，嗜此崔嵬藏。\n请从浮丘生，学笙翳凤凰。\n他年傥相思，矫首空断肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38560,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬夜读书无油歌","author":"朱复之","text":"君不见莱公酣歌彻清晓，银蜡成堆烧不了。\n又不见齐奴帐下环佳人，平生爨蜡不爨薪。\n南园花蜂巧心计，祇为渠侬照珠翠。\n生憎诗客太酸寒，略不分光到文字。\n欲学凿壁衡，邻火夜不明。\n欲学囊萤车，十月霜无萤。\n人生穷达真有分，大钧高高不须问。\n起来摩挲莲叶真人图，还有青藜老杖照我无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38561,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别汤伯纪","author":"朱复之","text":"停云思何长，伐木梦苦短。\n飘摇乘风来，倏霍抟沙散。\n匪今我独黯，自昔客屡叹。\n之子曷云戾，微阳逼候炭。\n囚山对线景，汲井共清盥。\n玉露泚金茎，水泉流藻翰。\n方竹桂芳袭，未觉枳栖远。\n仰天镜其团，一弛弓向半。\n书堂渴吾伊，伫立了瑟僩。\n子如飞鸿渐，我如禁门键。\n天寒柳无枝，指直不得挽。\n归来玩题墨，寂寂眯双眼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38562,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜饮罗怀叟三杯属余刚制共读孟郊诗","author":"朱复之","text":"建子初寒月，篝灯对语时。\n独醒苏客酒，细咏孟生诗。\n蠹老无新卷，乌惊有夜枝。\n白云路不远，明日肯重来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38563,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姑山","author":"朱复之","text":"他文太白不多奇，一赋姑山世绝希。\n生后此公方到此，龟趺不见仆前碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38564,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"枫","author":"朱复之","text":"凤山高兮上有枫，青女染叶猩血红。\n莫辞老红嫁西风，一夜憔悴成秃翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38565,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送码碯石屏","author":"朱复之","text":"削出云岑一片奇，天然玉瑩泽如脂。\n祇堪棐几旁边看，颇与文房辈行宜。\n香篆自萦黄奶卷，飞花不点墨卿池。\n粗官马上今无用，付与刘郎写近诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38566,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"朱复之","text":"疏竹生孙初上坂，矮松种子欲凌霄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38567,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"朱复之","text":"忽听夏禽三五弄，新红突过石榴枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38568,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"朱复之","text":"红蕖老去羞明镜，推让朱荣上蓼梢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38569,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遗诗","author":"朱宫人","text":"既不辱国，幸免辱身。\n世食宋禄，羞为北臣。\n妾辈之死，守于一贞。\n忠臣孝子，期以自新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38570,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游黄山","author":"朱彦","text":"三十六峰高插天，瑶台琼宇贮神仙。\n嵩阳若与黄山并，犹欠灵砂一道泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38571,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"朱显之","text":"空寻晋客维舟岸，不见秦朝避世人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38572,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送黄行者","author":"湖南使者","text":"自有棋来不计年，古今唯是说争先。\n个中一著如教会，杀尽三千与大千。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38573,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绍兴乙□中秋后五日乘休沐之□□舟□家为藏真之游","author":"朱某","text":"白首扁舟□访寻，江山□□□登临。\n□□□是□藏处，□□平生赏爱心。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38574,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宣和五年二月初九日偶书呈如公妙空禅师 其一","author":"朱济道","text":"二年催遣向东州，见尽东州水石幽。\n不把寻常费心眼，灵岩消得少迟留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38575,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宣和五年二月初九日偶书呈如公妙空禅师 其二","author":"朱济道","text":"东州山水亦堪游，及至灵岩分外幽。\n会有定师能指示，直须行到宝峰头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38576,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"朱皆","text":"千金常恨邻难买，一笑那知盖已倾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38577,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"朱皆","text":"墙东凉月频留夜，渡口垂杨几惜春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38578,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朱子庵","author":"朱诰","text":"落魄尘埃七十翁，平生梦想此山中。\n未应凡骨逢黄老，犹幸垂髫识莫公。\n泉涧泠泠皆佛法，竹符叶叶总神功。\n刀圭欲问吾仙祖，一洗尘劳万虑空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38579,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雁","author":"朱乘","text":"八月新霜岸草枯，数声哀怨雁来初。\n凭君试向沙汀看，恐带匈奴二帝书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38580,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"朱晋","text":"冰玉词新吐，尘埃气不留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38581,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"朱浚","text":"寺钟城鼓两相和，共醉烟关感慨多。\n堤柳垂金春几许，檐花鸣玉夜如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38582,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋日西湖","author":"朱浚","text":"几州陵变谷，经月雨为霖。\n世事今如此，西风动客心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38583,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"都城初秋和赵京倅 其二","author":"朱浚","text":"暑梦虫虫似醉中，片云挟雨过长空。\n不知秋色来多少，分数煖凉卜晚风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38584,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"都城初秋和赵京倅 其一","author":"朱浚","text":"从来美玉价连城，结佩乘风十二京。\n携上峥嵘今有约，好留彩笔调清平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38585,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"都城初秋和赵京倅 其三","author":"朱浚","text":"宇宙清愁望眼中，谁将凉雨借龙公。\n秋风夜入关河迥，破贼红旗?晓空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38586,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄友","author":"朱浚","text":"溪月知相忆，江云约共吟。\n夜船书一纸，飞过赤枫林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38587,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠卖墨吕云叔访陈烟山 其一","author":"朱浚","text":"仙宗传诀自分明，未数当年老树精。\n一片紫云光滴滴，丹墀成就几公卿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38588,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十一","author":"朱浚","text":"海燕故人意，杜鹃游子心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38589,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八","author":"朱浚","text":"明明采石兵前样，参赞归来即近臣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38590,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其九","author":"朱浚","text":"落花水煖千船聚，芳草春深一鹤归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38591,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"朱浚","text":"金寒霜气山无虎，剑动星光水有龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38592,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"朱浚","text":"红云近处催班急，只待春前奏凯归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38593,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"朱浚","text":"蓬莱春思重云上，江汉秋情十载前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38594,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"朱浚","text":"西风落叶长安梦，晚节寒华老圃心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38595,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十","author":"朱浚","text":"米车已过尘迷路，渔网才收月满船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38596,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十二","author":"朱浚","text":"故里千山隔，终年一字无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38597,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题小赤壁 其二","author":"朱涛","text":"千寻石上隐麻姑，会教蔡经起鼎炉。\n丹成龙去今何在，虎迹岩前叫鹧鸪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38598,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题小赤壁 其一","author":"朱涛","text":"此地不烧屯，何由壁自赤。\n意因丹炉烟，焰此千寻石。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38599,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题徐礼部家归去来图","author":"朱涣","text":"古木参天叫杜鹃，春愁浑在夕阳边。\n看君此画还三叹，忆得西江上水船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38600,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入山二首 其二","author":"朱涣","text":"溪头浴吾须，树底荫吾影。\n四顾无人来，独坐了俄顷。\n欲去更徘徊，夕阳射峰顶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38601,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入山二首 其一","author":"朱涣","text":"雨足溪涨缘，风高花委红。\n天清气自佳，独步来山中。\n见竹不敢穿，生怕伤箨龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38602,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"明月满庭树招马道士","author":"朱涣","text":"明月满庭树，与子步清影。\n参横北斗低，共此良夜永。\n一从明月缺，子即与我别。\n两桨泛西江，摇荡万顷雪。\n明月今复圆，子行阿那边。\n爱而不可见，望望空凄然。\n愿子理归舟，复向长安道。\n快来我庭前，趁此明月好。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38603,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蚁饮研槽歌","author":"朱涣","text":"晴窗棐几风日舒，呼童汲水供蟾蜍，涓流入研玄颖濡。\n一蚁蠢蠢爰来趋，须臾十百与之俱。\n前后有行不乱踰，宛若徙穴舁腐馀。\n想应燥吻唇颊枯，清梦思欲吞江湖。\n摇尾羞作涸辙呼，奋迅恰如东海鱼。\n物生天地小大殊，饥食渴饮皆同涂。\n矧尔有灵非至愚，大槐南柯名利区。\n一梦而觉惊幻虚，尔其听我毋睢盱。\n尔吭既沃腹既腴，归安其藏勿浪逋。\n阶前群儿政嬉娱，以指划土縻尔躯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38604,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]